      "content": "Emphasize the audit results as an opportunity to further strengthen the Miller Group's security posture and demonstrate their commitment to continuous improvement. Highlight the benefits of the Advanced Continuous Monitoring upgrade, such as enhanced threat detection, improved incident response, and regulatory compliance. Focus on how the upgrade will better position the Miller Group to mitigate potential risks and capitalize on emerging opportunities, rather than just meeting the department's upsell targets.",
